GET {{baseUrl}}/oauth/me

::: auth oauth2
profile = sample-machine

::: post
test("the token from client credentials is sent as a bearer header", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
  expect(res.json().grant).toBe("client_credentials");
  expect(res.json().scope).toBe("users:read");
  expect(res.json().via).toBe("header");
});

::: docs
Gets a token with the client credentials grant of the profile `sample-machine` before sending,
and sends it in the `Authorization` header.
